utheast-asia/a-79944798?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">China has been growing its economic relationships in Southeast Asia. Now new military facilities in Laos and Cambodia are causing smaller countries to worry China's military networks are also expanding.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Solar power production approaches record high</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63a1a1fd57a847889b3c6680d5b668768d8850e70a26d4ac988e216a90eec1ab</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T11:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-solar-power-production-approaches-record-high/live-79947500--1cc60de113f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-solar-power-production-approaches-record-high/live-79947500?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Solar power output in Germany in 2026 has already surpassed last year's total. Meanwhile, experts say the country is headed for a budget crisis. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wolf Biermann at 90: The singer who defied East Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a6dc4b8ef65d24d133d1f43867fa82e8cf64f7bf8c0e76f3769e3a50af0846c</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297--17726feda083.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">His life is a reflection of contemporary German history, which Biermann has addressed via his songs and sharp wit. Turning 90, he’s as feisty as ever.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Hungary: Millions in hidden cash found in Orban graft probe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:94f7cc8a14dd1251d783a03fd9b72a287ae16714f0a2203adc475d252dc4f536</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T09:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hungary-millions-in-hidden-cash-found-in-orban-graft-probe/a-79946923--46c1c05194eb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hungary-millions-in-hidden-cash-found-in-orban-graft-probe/a-79946923?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Investigators discovered bundles of banknotes buried in forests and concealed in buildings. The money was seized during an investigation into a former minister accused of accepting millions in bribes.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US loses measles-elimination status after 26 years, WSJ reports</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7336d92dc6c5fcc22ff9c13034edb88b76e0970a564cac42ee5eef003fb9cf9</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T09:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-loses-measles-elimination-status-after-26-years-wsj-reports/a-79946974--cd585e728f91.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-loses-measles-elimination-status-after-26-years-wsj-reports/a-79946974?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Pan American Health Organization has reportedly stripped the US of its measles-elimination status after 26 years, as the country battles its worst outbreaks in more than three decades.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Microsoft says all services working again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:64b2467ff23b096a17ef5802fb8d3a3879188f6aebe299257643e4809286f4fb</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T09:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/microsoft-says-all-services-working-again/a-79946887--03062deb25b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/microsoft-says-all-services-working-again/a-79946887?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US tech giant Microsoft says it has fixed problems that led to a global outage of its services. The glitch severely disrupted online communications in businesses and governments for more than 24 hours.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Sudan: Misery worsens amid plummeting aid for displaced people</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a6ad8997566cc2f8e10872f323d006308faf4f8b857bc12bc30df40c2c675bc</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T08:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sudan-misery-worsens-amid-plummeting-aid-for-displaced-people/a-79938864--624277167dba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sudan-misery-worsens-amid-plummeting-aid-for-displaced-people/a-79938864?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sudan's humanitarian crisis is exacerbated by cuts in international aid. Almost 34 million people are in need as war and drone strikes are making it difficult to deliver aid to the population.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria: How the pcoming elections are influeced by the rise of AI disinformation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:73e115da96d191261040ede358e24d0ac0a2822b7f378ed5b8ac5c2e88fdf873</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T07:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-how-the-pcoming-elections-are-influeced-by-the-rise-of-ai-disinformation/a-79946897--d58e239555ba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-how-the-pcoming-elections-are-influeced-by-the-rise-of-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Nigeria inches closer to the 2027 polls, the use of artificial intelligence in the electoral process has prompted questions about integrity and institutional readiness. Can Nigerians trust their democratic processes?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Turkey uses espionage accusations to pressure government critics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c2e8b526e47bb52de10fe8bcbebd9f8d0c9c76a6693aed6cae693bf50391cc4</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:49:59Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T07:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/turkey-uses-espionage-accusations-to-pressure-government-critics/a-79943768--a2686613e6a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-uses-espionage-accusations-to-pressure-government-critics/a-79943768?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The arrest of a German foundation's employee in Istanbul this week has put the focus back on pressure tactics used by the Erdogan administration. The arrest is far from the first of its kind.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India: Delhi surpasses Lahore as world's most polluted city</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c0f917fa404bdc2559bf3831a1861a35b4fc7fbecafe65e389fd30315768beb1</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T06:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-surpasses-lahore-as-world-s-most-polluted-city/live-79946817--53d17bc3619e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-surpasses-lahore-as-world-s-most-polluted-city/live-79946817?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Delhi's Air Quality Index (AQI) was recorded to be higher than Lahore in Pakistan on Friday, which made it the most polluted city globally.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gen Z protests: Do Baby Boomers really have it better than young people?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:41021e4251ab825b564fcf9b18942904f828e0e0265f3dc152cd04bdc937cef4</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T06:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gen-z-protests-do-baby-boomers-really-have-it-better-than-young-people/a-79918854--e581c42657a0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gen-z-protests-do-baby-boomers-really-have-it-better-than-young-people/a-79918854?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Should young people in Germany be more worried about their future than Baby Boomers were in the 1980s and 1990s? Or should both generations take to the streets and protest together? DW checked the data.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Senegal Youth Olympics in Dakar end on high note</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7945f3f15e55414e8d9d2ccfd2a23e8d830e959690fb9537e9c1c1b5e6c8e1af</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T04:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/senegal-youth-olympics-in-dakar-end-on-high-note/a-79944820--d8ec73fdda7d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/senegal-youth-olympics-in-dakar-end-on-high-note/a-79944820?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Enthusiastic crowds attended the games in Senegal, with China taking home the most gold medals. It's the first Olympic Games since Russia's war on Ukraine where Russian athletes can compete under their own flag.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump to meet Xi, Putin for three-way huddle on nuclear arms talks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c82df424e48c82d6b61b0428f88b447b1a36365e9a4d45ff547bbad9ce62601</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T04:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-to-meet-xi-putin-for-three-way-huddle-on-nuclear-arms-talks/a-79946408--68d06493f128.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-to-meet-xi-putin-for-three-way-huddle-on-nuclear-arms-talks/a-79946408?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The White House has said President Donald Trump will urge Xi Jinping and Vladimir Putin to discuss cutting nuclear arsenals in Shenzhen next week, though a senior US official expects no agreement.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>SpaceX launches Starship rocket, fails to recover booster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a98b9f34d48aeb32ad092dd8e1672abad6bff46b36760b691171401ee3257b84</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T02:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spacex-launches-starship-rocket-fails-to-recover-booster/a-79946091--bd09d60b45a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spacex-launches-starship-rocket-fails-to-recover-booster/a-79946091?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">SpaceX had planned to catch and later reuse both stages of its biggest rocket for the first time. But the booster exploded over the Gulf of Mexico, while the spacecraft continued into orbit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US lifts nationwide ground stop for airports hours after halting all departures</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aaa8d1914f7700710f162baa4321da694be36b72e42936bf57dc6212790e8177</id><updated>2026-11-14T20:48:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T01:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-lifts-nationwide-ground-stop-for-airports-hours-after-halting-all-departures/a-79945062--ab4e85db51f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-lifts-nationwide-ground-stop-for-airports-hours-after-halting-all-departures/a-79945062?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US federal aviation regulator has lifted a nationwide ground stop for all airports. Trump administration officials blame "overloaded" and "outdated" systems for the hourslong halt to departures.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
